****************** this folder intends to upload sensor data and create a web app to display the data ****************************8

1. the main.py file uses micropython for running on ESP32 module
2. the main.py file sends data to the firebase account provided token values
3. the app.py utilize flask to create a web application
4. the html file is used to display realtime database fetched from firebase
5. Use this repo : https://github.com/boochow/MicroPython-ST7735 for LCD display programming
6. for text search github sysfont 
